    decomposable
  * *note IsIdealUnmixed: IsIdealUnmixed, -- specify whether an ideal is
    unmixed
  * *note isLexCompatiblyGVD: isLexCompatiblyGVD, -- checks whether an ideal is
    <-compatibly geometrically vertex decomposable for a given order
  * *note isUnmixed: isUnmixed, -- checks whether an ideal is unmixed
