OnlyDegenerate -- restrict to degenerate geometric vertex decompositions
************************************************************************

Description
===========

Set to true to restrict the output of *note findOneStepGVD: findOneStepGVD, to
return only the indeterminates for which their geometric vertex decomposition
is degenerate. Default value false. Following the notation of *note oneStepGVD:
oneStepGVD,, a geometric vertex decomposition is degenerate if either
$\sqrt{C_{y, I}} = \sqrt{N_{y, I}}$ or if $C_{y, I} = \langle 1 \rangle$, and
is nondegenerate otherwise.



See also
========

